00:05:46.319 --> 00:05:53.710
And the reason that that is the case is because
it is a vestige of racial racist redlining.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.080
That's a systemic issue.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.100
That doesn't mean every aspect of society
is racist.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:03.699
There have been a number of interesting studies
done where the same resumes are submitted

00:06:03.699 --> 00:06:09.919
